 <h1 id="protocol">The Protocol</h1>
 
-<p>Moxie is not a smart contract on someone else&rsquo;s chain. It is a sovereign Layer 1 with consensus, execution, and clearing designed as a single system.</p>
+<p>Moxie is a sovereign Layer 1 whose consensus, execution, and clearing form a single system.</p>
 
-<p>The block executor runs three deterministic phases in fixed order. Phase 1 resolves attested outcomes and settles the claims that depend on them. Phase 2 clears all trading &mdash; order books, automated market makers, convex batch auctions, margin enforcement &mdash; against the freshly resolved state. Phase 3 processes everything else: transfers, staking, governance, EVM calls. The ordering is enforced at the protocol level; no reordering is possible.</p>
